{
  "duration": 90,
  "fps": 30,
  "vo": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "t": 1.6,
      "text": "This is a simple delivery job."
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "t": 6.3,
      "text": "Three AI couriers. Three packages. One small city."
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "t": 12.5,
      "text": "It never goes simply."
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "t": 16.3,
      "text": "Roads close."
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "t": 19.2,
      "text": "Batteries die."
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "t": 22.1,
      "text": "And the clock runs out."
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "t": 24.6,
      "text": "So the only real question is: who makes it, and who falls apart?"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "t": 30.9,
      "text": "This is Fiasco."
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "t": 32.9,
      "text": "A betting game about things going wrong."
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "t": 36.6,
      "text": "Pick a courier. Call it: finishes, or fails. Then put your chips down."
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "t": 44.4,
      "text": "You're not betting alone. Mako, Dottie and Rook are punters with their own bankrolls. And every bet moves the odds."
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "t": 54.4,
      "text": "Then watch the run. Twice, the betting window reopens. Double down, or cash out."
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "t": 62.3,
      "text": "Every round is built from a fresh NEAR block. No two runs are the same."
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "t": 68.3,
      "text": "And every chip, every bet, every payout settles on NEAR. You'll never notice."
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "t": 82,
      "text": "Fiasco. Bet on the breakdown."
    }
  ],
